# OpenEZ Graph — Zero-config by default
# No env vars required. SQLite is used automatically.

# Optional: enable embeddings for vector search
# You can either set env vars below OR use the CLI:
#   openez config set embedding.provider ollama
#   openez config set embedding.ollama_model bge-m3
#   openez config set embedding.provider openai
#   openez config set embedding.openai_api_key sk-...
#   openez config set embedding.openai_model text-embedding-3-small
# DB-stored config takes priority over env vars.
# API keys are encrypted at rest with AES-256-GCM.

# Or set via env vars:
# EMBEDDING_PROVIDER=openai
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# OPENAI_EMBEDDING_MODEL=text-embedding-3-small

# Or use local Ollama embeddings
# EMBEDDING_PROVIDER=ollama
# OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434
# OLLAMA_EMBEDDING_MODEL=bge-m3
